WEBVTT

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:12.320
<b>My Next Life as a Villainess:
All Routes Lead to Doom!</b>

00:01:31.850 --> 00:01:34.940
Um... So here...

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:40.120
<b>Episode 5 
I Visited the Heroine's Parents' House...</b>

00:01:35.230 --> 00:01:37.560
Here, you just do this.

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:41.670
Oh, okay! I get it!

00:01:41.670 --> 00:01:43.270
Thanks, Miss Campbell!

00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:45.430
I should make it through my next class now.

00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:46.580
I'm glad.

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:50.600
You write such thorough notes, though.

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:52.540
You're quite a hard worker, aren't you?

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:54.930
No, not really...

00:01:54.930 --> 00:01:58.170
If you need help with anything else, 
you can ask me anytime.

00:01:58.300 --> 00:01:59.520
Thanks!

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:06.280
Oh, I nearly forgot.

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:10.140
These are for you, if you'd like.

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:13.170
Did you make all these yourself?

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:15.140
I'd love some!

00:02:18.020 --> 00:02:19.490
It's delicious!

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:20.910
Thank you.

00:02:21.460 --> 00:02:24.860
<i>Maria-chan and I have grown 
a lot closer since then.</i>

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:29.020
<i>All the others have been 
captivated by her sweets, too.</i>

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:33.450
Here you go.

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:36.110
President! Thank you so much!

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:42.510
Delicious.

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:46.340
The student council president 
makes great tea, doesn't he?

00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:47.230
Yes.

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:50.230
I'd never guess that he was 
the son of nobility.

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:52.970
He beat Nicol to the top of his grade

00:02:52.970 --> 00:02:55.360
in both academic marks and magic ability.

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:59.530
I heard his fan club even 
has more members than Nicol's.

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:02.560
<i>Man, he's fast!</i>

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:06.120
<i>He only had a side role in the game, 
but he's actually a beast!</i>

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:10.090
Thank you for the tea again today.

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:12.010
You're welcome.

00:03:12.010 --> 00:03:14.800
You know, the tea you make...

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:18.250
has a very gentle flavor.

00:03:24.840 --> 00:03:28.830
<i>But the truth is that when 
I'm outside the student council office,</i>

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:33.100
<i>I don't see much 
of the president or Maria-chan.</i>

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:35.770
And we want to be better friends with Maria!

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:41.200
It seems like she keeps her distance 
from us outside the student council office.

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:45.430
Oh, Miss Campbell—

00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:52.340
Well, you can't blame her!

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:57.220
All these people, including Catarina, 
are among the highest nobility in the nation.

00:03:57.220 --> 00:04:00.540
It's probably hard for her 
to just strike up a conversation.

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:03.450
In the game, the conquerable characters

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:08.290
approach the heroine more and more 
as their affection levels rise.

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:12.940
But no one's approaching 
Maria-chan right now.

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:17.260
In fact, Catarina seems to have 
the highest affection toward Maria right now.

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:21.990
She always seems to be alone 
when not in the student council office.

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:26.940
It seems like Maria-san is being 
bullied by the other noble kids...

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:28.810
That's a huge problem!

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:30.450
<b>Emergency!</b>

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:30.450
<b>Huge problem!</b>

00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:30.450
Unthinkable!

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:34.910
Catarina witnessed such a scene once,

00:04:34.910 --> 00:04:38.490
but that was only the tip of the iceberg.

00:04:38.490 --> 00:04:39.970
We have to do something!

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:41.420
No objections!

00:04:49.420 --> 00:04:50.780
Sister, did you need something?

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:52.660
There's something I want to discuss!

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:54.480
H-Huh?

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:57.360
Oh... So that's it.

00:04:57.600 --> 00:05:02.190
What can I do to help protect Miss Campbell?

00:05:04.190 --> 00:05:08.790
Perhaps... we could stay 
with her as much as possible?

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:10.250
With her?

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:11.650
Yes.

00:05:11.650 --> 00:05:14.140
If she's with you and me,

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:18.330
they won't find it easy to bully her, 
considering statuses and all.

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:19.910
<i>That's it!</i>

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:25.420
<i>I'll make a move myself to spend more time 
with her outside the student council!</i>

00:05:25.690 --> 00:05:27.390
Thanks, Keith!

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:37.730
All right! It's lunch time!

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:40.100
I'll invite Maria-chan to eat with me.

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:45.940
She always ate lunch out here 
by herself in the game, if I recall...

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:47.740
You're just a commoner!

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:52.100
Don't get full of yourself just 
because you joined the student council.

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:55.560
I truly pity the student council 
members who feel they have

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:57.580
no choice but to pay attention to you.

00:05:57.580 --> 00:06:00.150
I bet your score on the achievement test

00:06:00.150 --> 00:06:03.380
was biased because 
your light magic is so special.

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:07.250
Don't get cocky!

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:11.650
Come forth, Earth Bump!

00:06:17.260 --> 00:06:18.500
<i>Did you see that?!</i>

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:22.730
<i>That's the power of my Earth Bump, 
the fruit of my years of training!</i>

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:27.470
Enough with your false accusations!

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:29.940
This school grades students 
based purely on merit.

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:32.040
There is no bias.

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:35.810
Maria-chan is always working her very hardest,

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:37.490
and her test showed 
the results of that effort!

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:40.600
Besides, the student council members and I

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:44.420
don't hang out with her 
just because of her light magic!

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:45.740
We do it because

00:06:45.740 --> 00:06:49.540
she's a hard worker who puts her all 
into everything, and we like her.

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:53.710
If you girls keep this up...

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:56.670
doom will befall you.

00:06:56.670 --> 00:07:00.310
<i>Just like it befalls the villainess 
Catarina Claes in the game!</i>

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:02.420
We're sorry!

00:07:03.490 --> 00:07:05.720
They're all such fools.

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:07.580
Maria-chan, are you oka—

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:11.540
Maria-chan?!

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:14.300
I know that was scary... 
but it's all right now!

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:17.580
Um, Lady Claes... My name...

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:18.600
Your name?

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:20.560
Oh! I'm sorry!

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:23.380
I just started calling you 
"Maria-chan" as if we're best friends...

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:26.350
No, I don't mind that at all.

00:07:26.350 --> 00:07:29.220
In fact, instead of "Maria-chan"... well...

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:33.050
Please just call me "Maria"!

00:07:36.820 --> 00:07:39.150
Thanks, Maria!

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:44.020
If you'll allow it,

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:50.590
may I also call you "Lady Catarina," 
like the student council members do?

00:07:50.590 --> 00:07:53.250
Of course! Call me whatever you like!

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:55.990
You and I are friends now, after all.

00:08:01.890 --> 00:08:04.410
Wait, what's wrong?!

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:12.190
I never thought they'd go so far 
as to use magic against her.

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:13.970
Oh!

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:16.640
Come to think of it, 
the Catarina in the game...

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:19.600
...did the same thing!

00:08:20.090 --> 00:08:21.630
One day, during lunch break,

00:08:21.630 --> 00:08:24.490
Catarina and the girls she used 
as her minions surrounded Maria,

00:08:24.490 --> 00:08:28.140
and one of them tried 
to hurt Maria with fire magic!

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:32.910
Then Keith produced an earth doll 
with this magic and saved her.

00:08:34.590 --> 00:08:38.410
And then Keith gently embraced her.

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:40.640
You know, Keith in that part...

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:44.890
He's normally a playboy, 
so he's not really used to acting like that.

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:48.120
That gap is just so hot!

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:50.960
<b>Emergency!</b>

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:50.960
<b>Huge problem!</b>

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:50.960
<b>Danger!</b>

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:50.970
So did we steal another 
major event from her?!

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:52.740
First it was Geordo,

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:56.300
and now we've taken a crucial 
relationship event from Keith...

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:59.240
But maybe that's for the better.

00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:03.460
I mean, if those two work out, 
Catarina could be doomed.

00:09:03.460 --> 00:09:06.040
In other words, since the event with Geordo,

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:08.570
we continue to unintentionally maintain 
distance from our own doom flag.

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:10.250
Am I amazing or what?!

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:12.020
Amazing!

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:12.020
Super amazing!

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:15.800
Amazing... I'm amazing...

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:26.040
<i>That said, I still need to keep 
tabs on the progress of Maria-chan's</i>

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:28.080
<i>relationships with 
the conquerable characters.</i>

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:31.960
<i>Which makes this the perfect time 
for girl talk about relationships!</i>

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:35.430
So, Maria, who do you like?

00:09:35.430 --> 00:09:36.240
Huh?

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:41.860
I... am deeply fond of you, Lady Catarina.

00:09:41.860 --> 00:09:42.220
Huh?

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:44.840
Me, too! More than anyone else!

00:09:44.840 --> 00:09:47.690
Me, too! I feel the same, Lady Catarina!

00:09:47.860 --> 00:09:49.980
Thanks, everyone...

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:54.150
<i>That does make me happy, but that's 
not the kind of "like" I meant...</i>

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:57.370
You're all welcome to 
have some of these if you'd like.

00:09:58.180 --> 00:09:59.720
I'd love to!

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:02.810
Delicious!

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:07.310
<i>Maria-chan's as cute as can be again today.</i>

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:11.710
<i>Even if I swiped a couple of relationship 
events from her by pure coincidence,</i>

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:16.300
<i>it's just a matter of time before 
the conquerable characters fall for her.</i>

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:16.630
<b>Maria My Love</b>

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:16.630
<b>M
a
r
i
a</b>

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:16.630
<b>Maria</b>

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:19.220
<i>Time to beef up my strategy!</i>

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:20.710
I know!

00:10:20.710 --> 00:10:23.680
Why don't we all go out somewhere 
together on our next day off?

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:25.900
Oh, that sounds wonderful.

00:10:25.900 --> 00:10:30.140
I'm sorry, but I'm supposed to return 
to my parents' house on days off.

00:10:30.370 --> 00:10:35.260
Then, let's plan something 
when it suits all of our schedules.

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:36.830
Yes, let's.

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:39.660
You're spending the day off 
with your family, Miss Maria?

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:41.240
You must be looking forward to that!

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:42.200
Huh?

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:44.860
Y-Yes...

00:10:54.010 --> 00:10:57.560
Real fields on real farms are so incredible!

00:10:57.560 --> 00:11:00.250
The size and scale 
of them don't even compare!

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:03.430
Why did we have to come 
to a place like this on our day off?

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:05.820
Sister?

00:11:05.820 --> 00:11:07.430
Why are you dressed like that?

00:11:09.340 --> 00:11:11.470
The fields! I'm going to the fields!

00:11:11.470 --> 00:11:13.760
The fields? But they're right here.

00:11:13.760 --> 00:11:15.130
Not these!

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:18.750
I want to go to a real farm and see a big field!

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:20.150
Huh? Why?

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:22.000
Well, of course...

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:24.740
so I can become a skilled 
farmer if the need arises!

00:11:25.520 --> 00:11:28.360
I don't even know where to start...

00:11:29.050 --> 00:11:34.380
I'm disguised as a merchant's daughter 
so no one will know I'm a noble.

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:38.210
So let's get this undercover 
observation started!

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:39.470
Right, right...

00:12:08.960 --> 00:12:12.290
The undercover plan worked perfectly!

00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:13.670
Huh?

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:15.090
Is that...

00:12:15.090 --> 00:12:17.880
I believe that's Maria Campbell's hometown.

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:19.410
That's Maria's town?!

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:21.600
If we go there now, maybe we could see her!

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:24.350
What? It'd be rude to show up unannounced!

00:12:24.350 --> 00:12:26.740
It's just for a little bit! It'll be fine!

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:30.270
Yay! I get to see Maria! Let's go!

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:32.090
Sister, calm down!

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:48.880
Mom, is there anything I can do?

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:51.550
Oh... Could you go on a shopping run for me?

00:12:51.550 --> 00:12:52.370
Sure.

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:59.380
Wow... So this is Maria's town, huh?

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:02.400
Sister, you don't even know 
where her house is, do you?

00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:04.590
Oh, come to think of it, I don't.

00:13:05.080 --> 00:13:09.090
Excuse me! Do you know where 
Miss Maria Campbell lives?

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:12.720
Maria Campbell? Yes, of course I know.

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:15.010
Maria's quite famous in this town.

00:13:15.130 --> 00:13:17.480
Famous? Really?

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:20.780
She's been an extraordinary girl 
ever since she was little.

00:13:20.780 --> 00:13:23.910
She's a commoner 
with light magic, after all.

00:13:24.550 --> 00:13:27.990
You're right. She's very special, isn't she?

00:13:28.130 --> 00:13:30.970
To get to the Campbells' house, 
just follow this street,

00:13:30.970 --> 00:13:32.490
and when you're past the trees...

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:39.740
This is such a lovely, peaceful place.

00:13:39.740 --> 00:13:40.600
Yeah.

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:41.580
You there!

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:44.820
Are you a friend of Maria's?

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:48.590
Then you must know, right? 
Who is Maria's real father?

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:49.750
Huh?

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:51.300
Her real father?

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:53.890
Come on, now. Don't pretend you don't know.

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:56.790
Her real father is a noble, isn't he?

00:13:56.790 --> 00:13:58.850
That's why she can use light magic!

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:02.480
Um... I'm not sure what you—

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:04.130
She's a noble's illegitimate child, right?!

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:06.990
It's no wonder her family fell apart!

00:14:09.690 --> 00:14:11.380
We're in a hurry.

00:14:11.730 --> 00:14:14.410
You'll have to excuse us, ladies.

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:22.900
Gosh, Keith, there was no need 
to take off running...

00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:25.090
Don't worry about what they said.

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:27.320
Rumors are only rumors.

00:14:29.920 --> 00:14:32.380
That must be the Campbells' house.

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:45.260
Hello!

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:51.150
May I ask who's calling?

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:55.220
I'm Miss Maria's friend. 
My name is Catarina Claes.

00:14:55.220 --> 00:14:56.650
I'm her brother, Keith.

00:14:56.780 --> 00:14:58.910
Friends of Maria's?

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:01.250
Is Miss Maria home?

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:03.780
I'm sorry to say she isn't right now.

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:06.670
Would you like to wait for her inside?

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:08.250
Thank you!

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:09.970
Here you go.

00:15:10.310 --> 00:15:13.580
Wow! Did Miss Maria make these?

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:16.700
What? Ah, no... These were purchased.

00:15:16.700 --> 00:15:19.210
Oh... I'm sorry.

00:15:19.210 --> 00:15:21.730
I thought perhaps she had made them.

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:24.050
She always shares her 
homemade sweets with me.

00:15:24.050 --> 00:15:27.530
What? She's been making sweets?

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:30.610
Yes! They're really delicious, aren't they?

00:15:31.260 --> 00:15:32.080
Huh?

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:34.740
Yes...

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:35.820
I'm back.

00:15:36.140 --> 00:15:39.430
Lady Catarina and Master Keith? 
What are you doing here?

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:41.260
Here we are!

00:15:41.260 --> 00:15:43.120
We apologize for coming over unannounced.

00:15:43.230 --> 00:15:46.750
No... I'm happy to see you on our day off!

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:52.730
I-I'm sorry...

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:55.840
I suddenly felt hungry 
the moment I saw your face.

00:15:56.530 --> 00:15:59.500
Since you're here, 
why don't I make some sweets?

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:02.080
Will you?! Yay!

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:04.990
In that case, I don't know 
if you could call it a favor in return,

00:16:04.990 --> 00:16:07.520
but would you mind 
if I borrowed your field for a bit?

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:08.150
What?

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:09.400
Sister!

00:16:09.520 --> 00:16:13.260
Working fields is actually a hobby of mine.

00:16:13.260 --> 00:16:16.360
And I brought some great seedlings 
that I just got my hands on!

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:19.700
I never knew you had a hobby like that...

00:16:20.010 --> 00:16:22.330
Of course, I don't mind.

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:24.300
Thank you!

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:34.910
I'm sure Lady Catarina 
is going to be very hungry.

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:37.540
I'll have to make lots.

00:16:45.370 --> 00:16:46.300
Here.

00:16:59.010 --> 00:17:02.070
<i>I was the kind of normal 
child you'd see anywhere.</i>

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:21.050
<i>But after my light magic became 
active, everything changed.</i>

00:17:21.420 --> 00:17:24.630
<i>There are very few 
commoners who possess magic.</i>

00:17:24.630 --> 00:17:30.030
<i>Everyone avoided me and suspected 
that I was a noble's illegitimate child.</i>

00:17:34.960 --> 00:17:39.340
<i>I tried my best to regain my former happiness.</i>

00:17:39.340 --> 00:17:43.660
<i>I worked my hardest to not let 
it all be blamed on my magic.</i>

00:17:43.930 --> 00:17:49.380
<i>Before I knew it, I was drawing 
everyone's attention as a "special child."</i>

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:53.450
<i>But in the end, nothing changed.</i>

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:57.420
<i>What must I do to make them see me?</i>

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:33.200
<i>I just wished that someone, 
anyone, would look at me...</i>

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:35.770
<i>from the bottom of my heart.</i>

00:18:42.300 --> 00:18:46.110
<i>After that day, Maria stopped making sweets.</i>

00:18:47.210 --> 00:18:49.620
<i>I couldn't say anything to her.</i>

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:52.360
<i>I was too wrapped up in my own problems.</i>

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:55.560
<i>I couldn't even look at my own daughter.</i>

00:18:56.270 --> 00:18:58.610
<i>What a cruel mother I am...</i>

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:02.940
<i>I'm still the same as I was then,</i>

00:19:03.900 --> 00:19:05.710
<i>but Maria...</i>

00:19:43.140 --> 00:19:45.020
Use these.

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:49.950
I remember these!

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:51.380
I'll help you.

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:11.520
Let's dig in!

00:20:12.800 --> 00:20:14.150
They're delicious!

00:20:14.780 --> 00:20:16.270
I'm so glad.

00:20:16.270 --> 00:20:18.860
Maria makes the best sweets ever!

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:19.600
Indeed!

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:21.110
Thank you so much.

00:20:26.090 --> 00:20:31.440
Thank you for tidying 
up our field so nicely.

00:20:31.440 --> 00:20:34.100
It was no problem at all.
Thank you for the sweets and tea.

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:37.300
You'll have to look forward to 
finding out what'll grow in that field.

00:20:37.970 --> 00:20:40.200
Please come visit again sometime.

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:41.870
I'd love to.

00:20:41.870 --> 00:20:42.760
Goodbye.

00:20:43.860 --> 00:20:44.940
Um...

00:20:45.820 --> 00:20:49.620
Please continue to be 
a good friend to my daughter.

00:20:54.390 --> 00:20:56.030
Of course!

00:20:56.030 --> 00:20:58.520
And thank you for giving me your blessing!

00:21:20.620 --> 00:21:23.290
This has been a fantastic day!

00:21:23.290 --> 00:21:26.330
I sort of wish I could see our mother now.

00:21:26.330 --> 00:21:28.130
Shall we stop by on our way, then?

00:21:29.990 --> 00:21:31.780
Mother!

00:21:31.780 --> 00:21:33.650
Sister, your outfit—

00:21:36.020 --> 00:21:38.230
Welcome home, Catarina.

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:41.370
What an unusual outfit you're wearing.

00:21:41.370 --> 00:21:44.450
Well, you can tell me all about that later.

00:21:45.040 --> 00:21:48.280
I heard a strange rumor at a tea party 
for the ladies' association.

00:21:48.580 --> 00:21:50.490
A... A strange rumor?

00:21:52.090 --> 00:21:55.270
It said that someone had 
started a farm, of all things,

00:21:55.270 --> 00:21:59.380
on the venerable magic academy grounds.

00:22:02.370 --> 00:22:06.970
Catarina, why don't we have 
a little chat in my room?
